BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:example-snake-plant-20260923@plant-care
DTSTAMP:20260919T134632Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260923
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260924
SUMMARY:Water Snake Plant (example)
DESCRIPTION:300 ml — about 1 1/4 cups\nSoak the soil\, then let it dry ou
 t completely before the next watering\nLight: Tolerates low light\, happie
 st in medium indirect\nWhere: Bedroom corner\nWatch for: Mushy base or lea
 ves falling over = overwatered. Wrinkled leaves = under-watered.\nNotes: T
 he most common way to kill this plant is kindness — when in doubt\, skip
  a watering.\nLog it: https://nsfogg.github.io/plant_watering/#today
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER;RELATED=START:PT8H
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Water Snake Plant (example) — 300 ml — about 1 1/4 cups
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
